<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <AlienRace.ThingDef_AlienRace ParentName="BasePawn"><!-- 种族定义，BasePawn-->
    <defName>Alien_Rukaya</defName>
    <label>Rukaya</label>
    <!-- 中文翻译：卢卡娅 -->
    <description>The Rukaya are a long-lived, predominantly female near-human race. They possess distinct chiropteran features, most notably keen animal ears and wings on their backs. Physiologically, they are highly adapted to a nocturnal lifestyle, preferring quiet and dimly lit environments. Psychologically, their extended lifespans burden the entire race with a heavy, indelible collective memory.


      They are not native to this sector of the rim, but hail from a distant, ancient homeworld. In the past, their civilization built its advanced technology around a special resource known as "Active Matter," which remains central to their industry and armaments. Their homeworld was eventually lost, and its scattered survivors now carry on among the stars.</description>
    <!--卢卡娅是一个以女性为主的长寿亚人种族。她们拥有明显的翼手目特征——敏锐的兽耳与背部的双翼。在生理上，卢卡娅高度适应夜行生活，偏好安静、低光照的环境；而在心理上，漫长的寿命让她们的族群始终背负着难以磨灭的沉重记忆。

她们并非这片边缘星域的原住民，而是来自一颗遥远的古老母星。在过去，她们的文明围绕一种名为“活性物质”的特殊资源建立起了先进的技术，这种资源至今仍是其工业与军备的核心。她们的母星最终失落了，散落星海的幸存者如今在群星之间延续着生活。 -->

